Fix function pointer casts: call class, instance and interface init functions with the signature
they are called through (WebAssembly checks the signature of every indirect call).

From Kleis Auke Wolthuizen's "Fix function pointer cast issues" (github.com/kleisauke/glib,
branch wasm-vips-2.88.1, commit 1afd0d285774, used by wasm-vips), adapted to 2.88.4, plus the
functions of 2.88.4 it does not cover (addons/wpe/tools/check-fpcasts.py --fix), the
GDestroyNotify / GCompareFunc callers of glist, gslist, gqueue, gasyncqueue, garray and gtree, and
the instance init and class finalize of G_DEFINE_DYNAMIC_TYPE.

